      <span class="tier" style="color:${t.c}">${t.label}</span><span class="eyebrow"> / ${esc(th.card.topic)}</span></div>`;}).join('');
  const open=openThreads(),settled=threads.filter(t=>t.status==='settled');
  const gapHtml=gaps.length?`<div class="eyebrow" style="margin:24px 0 8px">Groundwork queued</div>`+
    gaps.map(g=>`<div class="saved-item"><div class="idea">${esc(g.concept)}</div>
      <p class="basis">${esc(g.why)}</p></div>`).join(''):'';
  $('saved-list').innerHTML=(threads.length||gaps.length)
    ?render(open)+(settled.length?`<div class="eyebrow" style="margin:24px 0 8px">Settled</div>`+render(settled):'')+gapHtml
    :`<p class="sub">Nothing here yet. Dispute a rating, flag a card, or say something's over your head.</p>`;
  show('s-saved');
};
$('back').onclick=()=>show('s-done');
if('serviceWorker' in navigator&&location.protocol==='https:')
  navigator.serviceWorker.register('./sw.js').catch(()=>{});
load();
</script>
</body>
</html>
